  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Prote&#xe7;&#xe3;o, Assist&#xea;ncia e Solu&#xe7;&#xf5;es</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Response to Humanitarian Needs in the North</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">A presta&#xe7;&#xe3;o de prote&#xe7;&#xe3;o eficaz, assist&#xea;ncia e solu&#xe7;&#xf5;es duradouras para refugiados, pessoas deslocadas internamente (PDI) e outras v&#xed;timas de conflitos e cat&#xe1;strofes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this award is to provide financial support to UNICEF for a program entitled response to humanitarian needs in the north in Mozambique. The program objective is to ensure improved access to lifesaving and life-supporting child protection, WASH and nutrition services for children and adolescents displaced by the conflict in cabo delgado. UNICEF estimates reaching 104,715 participants.</narrative>
  </description>
